    {
      "text": "↵每當 WD Cloud 韌體更新時，你會失去所有自訂配置。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下腳本幫助我恢復我的設定，",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "登入 WD Cloud 的 root 並在伺服器端建立 .ssh，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "從你的機器上傳公鑰到伺服器，將 _**nas**_ 替換為你的主機/IP 位址。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在伺服器端↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "你可以在不輸入密碼的情況下 ssh 到 nas。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "簡而言之，↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated",
        "title": "WD Cloud 韌體更新後的設定腳本",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/setup-script-after-wd-cloud-firmware-updated/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "如果你不想建構套件，你可以從 https://app.box.com/wdcloud 下載。",
